{"name":"渐变","description":"渐变是一种让两个或多个颜色在指定方向或范围内连续过渡的视觉效果 · 线性渐变适合形成方向感，径向渐变可把注意力聚到一个区域，例如产品页的背景光晕。颜色感受会随明度、面积和品牌而变化；文字覆盖在渐变上时要检查整段区域的对比度，并准备可读的纯色回退。","quote":"背景别用纯色，让颜色从蓝慢慢过渡到紫。","agentPrompt":"请保留 Hero 蓝紫渐变，但检查标题可能覆盖的每个区域，调整色阶、遮罩或文字位置确保可读，并提供纯色回退。不要把同一渐变铺满全页；在深浅模式和窄屏换行下重新验收。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-gradient\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>渐变<span>Gradient</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">背景别用纯色，让颜色从蓝慢慢过渡到紫。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">渐变是一种让两个或多个颜色在指定方向或范围内连续过渡的视觉效果</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>线性渐变适合形成方向感，径向渐变可把注意力聚到一个区域，例如产品页的背景光晕。颜色感受会随明度、面积和品牌而变化；文字覆盖在渐变上时要检查整段区域的对比度，并准备可读的纯色回退。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"grad-demo\">\n    <span class=\"grad-chip grad-linear\">线性 · 活力</span>\n    <span class=\"grad-chip grad-radial\">径向 · 聚焦</span>\n    <span class=\"grad-chip grad-duo\">双色 · 潮流</span>\n    <span class=\"grad-chip grad-mono\">同色 · 克制</span>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请保留 Hero 蓝紫渐变，但检查标题可能覆盖的每个区域，调整色阶、遮罩或文字位置确保可读，并提供纯色回退。不要把同一渐变铺满全页；在深浅模式和窄屏换行下重新验收。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>线性渐变做 Hero 背景</b>：方向感带来向前的活力</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"padding:0;overflow:hidden\"><span style=\"display:block;height:52px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#165dff,#722ed1)\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>径向渐变做聚焦</b>：光晕把视线聚到主体上</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:96px;height:52px;border-radius:7px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,#7fb2ff,#165dff);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\"><span class=\"mk-btn\" style=\"background:var(--bg);color:var(--brand);border:none;font-size:12px;padding:1px 8px\">开始</span></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>双色调 / 多色</b>：撞色渐变适合活动页和年轻品牌，能带来更鲜明的潮流感</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:52px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f76965,#f7ba1e)\"></span><span style=\"width:52px;height:34px;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#722ed1,#14c9c9)\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>同色系深浅</b>：可用于 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/card?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"card\" aria-label=\"卡片 Card\">卡片 <b>Card</b></a> 或背景营造层次；先检查文字与状态的对比度，不把“高级感”当结果保证</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"min-height:52px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f7faff,#dbe7ff);border:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:75%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:52%\"></i></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">将<b>高饱和对比渐变用于正文背景</b>：可能干扰文字阅读</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"min-height:52px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f53f3f,#287947);border:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#fff\">夏日活动今天开始，登录后即可领取奖励</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">文字叠在渐变上<b>未验证对比度</b>：不同区域可能难以辨认</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"min-height:52px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#165dff,#e8f0ff);border:none\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#fff\">会员权益说明</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">渐变<b>方向和色系缺少规则</b>：会削弱页面的视觉一致性</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:34px;height:24px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(45deg,#165dff,#722ed1)\"></span><span style=\"width:34px;height:24px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f53f3f,#f7ba1e)\"></span><span style=\"width:34px;height:24px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(270deg,#287947,#14c9c9)\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">一个页面<b>多处使用渐变</b>：视觉重点难以区分</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#165dff,#722ed1)\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f76965,#f7ba1e)\"></span><span style=\"height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#287947,#14c9c9)\"></span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"grad-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"start\"><span class=\"grad-anat-dot\" style=\"background:#165dff\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"direction\"><span class=\"grad-anat-arrow\">⟶</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"stop\"><span class=\"grad-anat-bar\"><i class=\"grad-anat-stop\"></i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"end\"><span class=\"grad-anat-dot\" style=\"background:#722ed1\"></span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"start\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">起点色</span><span class=\"pe\">Start</span></button><span class=\"pd\">渐变从它开始</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"direction\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">方向</span><span class=\"pe\">Direction</span></button><span class=\"pd\">线性渐变的角度，决定流动感</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"stop\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">色标</span><span class=\"pe\">Color Stop</span></button><span class=\"pd\">中途的停靠色，能做三色以上</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"end\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">终点色</span><span class=\"pe\">End</span></button><span class=\"pd\">渐变到它结束</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">线性渐变<span>Linear</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"grad-v grad-linear\"></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">Hero 背景，方向感带来活力</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">径向渐变<span>Radial</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"grad-v grad-radial\"></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">聚焦主体，营造光晕氛围</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">双色调<span>Duotone</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"grad-v grad-duo\"></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">年轻潮流的品牌活动页</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">同色系深浅<span>Tonal</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"grad-v grad-mono\"></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">想保持克制、又需要轻微层次时</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Hero 区大背景</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--brand),#8b5cf6)\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:8px 14px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#fff\">Flowbase</span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)\">产品　定价　登录</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:12px 14px 18px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;color:#fff\">团队协作，<br>从此顺滑如流</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);margin:6px 0 10px\">免费试用 14 天，随时取消。</div>\n        <button class=\"btn\" style=\"background:var(--bg);color:var(--brand);border:none\">免费开始</button>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">品牌活动页</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f76965,#8b5cf6);padding:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n        <span class=\"demo-tag\" style=\"color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.2)\">夏日造物节 · 限时</span>\n        <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-top:8px\">全场满 300 减 60</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);margin:4px 0 10px\">7 月 21 日 20:00 开抢，会员提前 1 小时。</div>\n        <button class=\"btn\" style=\"background:var(--bg);color:#f53f3f;border:none\">立即预约</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:none;text-align:center;color:#fff\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">02:14:36</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)\">距开抢</div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">图标与头像点缀</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1;color:var(--text)\">消息</b>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\">＋</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#8b5cf6);color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px\">林</span>\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">林小满 <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">把终稿发你了</span></span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">10:24</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:7px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;flex:none;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f7ba1e,#f76965);color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px\">✦</span>\n        <span style=\"flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">灵感订阅 <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">本周精选已更新</span></span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">09:02</span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">卡片微渐变底色</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f7f9ff,#e3e9ff);padding:12px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">本月活跃用户</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin:4px 0 2px\">12,408</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green)\">↑ 8.2% 较上月</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f7f9ff,#e3e9ff);padding:12px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">平均停留时长</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin:4px 0 2px\">6分42秒</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green)\">↑ 3.1% 较上月</div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/gradient/linear-gradient\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">linear-gradient() 线性渐变</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/gradient","markdown":"# 渐变Gradient\n\n你可能会说\n背景别用纯色，让颜色从蓝慢慢过渡到紫。\n\n**渐变是一种让两个或多个颜色在指定方向或范围内连续过渡的视觉效果**·线性渐变适合形成方向感，径向渐变可把注意力聚到一个区域，例如产品页的背景光晕。颜色感受会随明度、面积和品牌而变化；文字覆盖在渐变上时要检查整段区域的对比度，并准备可读的纯色回退。\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请保留 Hero 蓝紫渐变，但检查标题可能覆盖的每个区域，调整色阶、遮罩或文字位置确保可读，并提供纯色回退。不要把同一渐变铺满全页；在深浅模式和窄屏换行下重新验收。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **线性渐变做 Hero 背景**：方向感带来向前的活力\n- **径向渐变做聚焦**：光晕把视线聚到主体上\n\n开始\n- **双色调 / 多色**：撞色渐变适合活动页和年轻品牌，能带来更鲜明的潮流感\n- **同色系深浅**：可用于 [卡片 **Card**](/vibe-hub/card?lang=zh) 或背景营造层次；先检查文字与状态的对比度，不把“高级感”当结果保证\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 将**高饱和对比渐变用于正文背景**：可能干扰文字阅读\n\n夏日活动今天开始，登录后即可领取奖励\n- 文字叠在渐变上**未验证对比度**：不同区域可能难以辨认\n\n会员权益说明\n- 渐变**方向和色系缺少规则**：会削弱页面的视觉一致性\n- 一个页面**多处使用渐变**：视觉重点难以区分\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n⟶\n\n1起点色Start渐变从它开始\n\n2方向Direction线性渐变的角度，决定流动感\n\n3色标Color Stop中途的停靠色，能做三色以上\n\n4终点色End渐变到它结束\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n线性渐变Linear\n\nHero 背景，方向感带来活力\n\n径向渐变Radial\n\n聚焦主体，营造光晕氛围\n\n双色调Duotone\n\n年轻潮流的品牌活动页\n\n同色系深浅Tonal\n\n想保持克制、又需要轻微层次时\n\n典型使用场景\n\nHero 区大背景\n\nFlowbase\n        产品　定价　登录\n\n      \n团队协作，\n从此顺滑如流\n\n        \n免费试用 14 天，随时取消。\n\n        免费开始\n\n品牌活动页\n\n夏日造物节 · 限时\n        \n全场满 300 减 60\n\n        \n7 月 21 日 20:00 开抢，会员提前 1 小时。\n\n        立即预约\n\n      \n02:14:36\n\n        \n距开抢\n\n图标与头像点缀\n\n**消息**\n        ＋\n\n      \n林\n        林小满 把终稿发你了\n        10:24\n\n      \n✦\n        灵感订阅 本周精选已更新\n        09:02\n\n卡片微渐变底色\n\n本月活跃用户\n\n        \n12,408\n\n        \n↑ 8.2% 较上月\n\n      \n平均停留时长\n\n        \n6分42秒\n\n        \n↑ 3.1% 较上月\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[linear-gradient() 线性渐变MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/gradient/linear-gradient)"}